So go to how we made your mother.com or HWMYM.com, go to contact and just follow the instructions.
因此，请转到我们如何创建您的 mother.com 或 HWMYM.com，前往联系方式并按照说明进行操作。

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:42.299
It should be pretty self-explanatory.
这应该是不言自明的。

00:08:42.299 --> 00:08:43.299
