我真的很喜欢这本书。

00:29:05.759 --> 00:29:13.500
I think I told Craig, even if he was my sworn enemy, I would be forced to admit he had written a great book.
我想我告诉克雷格，即使他是我的死敌，我也不得不承认他写了一本伟大的书。

00:29:13.500 --> 00:29:16.079
It's just such- But then you'd beat me to death with the book.
就是这样——但是你却用这本书把我打死了。

00:29:16.079 --> 00:29:17.160
Yeah, exactly.
