00:29:17.160 --> 00:29:19.119
It's just such a great read.
这真是一本很棒的书。

00:29:19.119 --> 00:29:19.960
It's so page 20.
原来是20页啊

00:29:19.960 --> 00:29:20.799
Thank you.
谢谢。

