It's so funny.
太搞笑了。

00:29:21.640 --> 00:29:22.920
It's so really about something.
这确实是关于某件事的。

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:32.039
It's one of those books that feels both nourishing intellectually and soulfully, but it's also hilarious and just a joy to read.
这是一本在智力和灵魂上都得到滋养的书，但它也很搞笑，读起来很愉快。

00:29:32.039 --> 00:29:32.880
Thanks, my friend.
谢谢，我的朋友。

00:29:32.880 --> 00:29:35.640
I really think it was a, you really pulled something off there.
我真的认为这是一个，你真的做到了一些事情。

