00:30:02.759 --> 00:30:09.960
And I will say it's always a great thing when you can write what you know and when you can be taking things from your life and processing them into art.
我想说，当你能写下你所知道的东西，当你能从生活中汲取东西并将它们加工成艺术时，这总是一件很棒的事情。

00:30:09.960 --> 00:30:13.440
